   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cohesion and connectors in formal letters",
     "texto": [
      "Every formal letter or email opens with a formula such as **Sehr geehrte Damen und Herren** or **Sehr geehrte Frau Müller**. After the comma of the greeting, the body of the letter starts in lower case. To justify the reason for the message, connectors such as **deshalb**, **aus diesem Grund** or the genitive preposition **wegen** are used: **Deshalb schreibe ich Ihnen heute wegen des Termins**. The usual closing has no comma: **Mit freundlichen Grüßen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
