     "tipo": "test",
     "id": "de217-1",
     "pregunta": {
      "texto": "After the formal greeting with a comma («Sehr geehrte Frau Klein,»), how should the first word of the text begin?",
      "lengua": "alumno"
     },
     "frase": {
      "texto": "",
      "lengua": "alumno"
     },
     "traduccion": "",
     "audio": "",
     "oir_frase": false,
     "opciones": [
      {
       "texto": "In lower case, unless it is a noun or pronoun that always takes a capital.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "In German, after the comma of the greeting no full stop is used and the sentence continues in lower case.",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "Always with an initial capital in any case.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "It doesn't follow the Spanish rule of a colon followed by a capital letter.",
       "correcta": false
      },
      {
       "texto": "With an opening question mark.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "German doesn't use opening question marks.",
       "correcta": false
      }
     ],
     "respuestas": {
      "lengua": "estudio",
      "textos": []
     },
     "explicacion": "",
     "autoevaluacion": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "traduccion",
     "id": "de217-2",
     "pregunta": {
      "texto": "What does it mean?",
      "lengua": "alumno"
     },
     "frase": {
      "texto": "Deshalb schreibe ich Ihnen heute wegen des Termins.",
      "lengua": "estudio"
     },
     "traduccion": "",
     "audio": "",
     "oir_frase": false,
     "opciones": [
      {
       "texto": "That's why I'm writing to you today about the appointment.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "Deshalb (therefore) + schreibe ich (I'm writing) + wegen des Termins (about the appointment).",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "That's why I didn't want to reply to your last letter.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "It contradicts the communicative purpose of the sentence.",
       "correcta": false
      },
      {
       "texto": "I wrote to you last week to confirm the appointment.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "It would express a completed past.",
       "correcta": false
      }
     ],
     "respuestas": {
